<tr id="S6.T3.2.1.6" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="S6.T3.2.1.6.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_border_t">Correct <math id="S6.T3.m16" class="ltx_Math" alttext="&gt;" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mo>&gt;</mo><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">&gt;</annotation></semantics></math> Irrelevant</td>
