<section id="A2.SS1.SSS0.Px2" class="ltx_paragraph">
<h4 class="ltx_title ltx_title_paragraph">Prompting with Answer</h4>

<div id="A2.SS1.SSS0.Px2.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A2.SS1.SSS0.Px2.p1.1" class="ltx_p">This format uses a multi-turn chat interaction. First, the model generates an answer. Then, in a second turn, it is asked to provide a confidence score for the generated answer.</p>
</div>
<div id="A2.SS1.SSS0.Px2.p2" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A2.SS1.SSS0.Px2.p2.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A2.SS1.SSS0.Px2.p2.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">Turn 1:</span></p>
</div>
<div id="A2.SS1.SSS0.Px2.p3" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
